It is January in Copenhagen.
I am standing in my temporary room.
Today I am moving to a new apartment.
It is in the same building.
My large suitcase stands on the floor.
I close it.
I look around the room one last time.
I look under the small bed.
There is a book lying under the bed.
It is from Mexico.
I put the book in my bag.
I open the closet.
There is a pair of shoes standing in the closet.
I take the shoes.
Now there is nothing in the closet.
I walk over to the desk by the window.
There is a cable lying on the desk.
I take the cable.
I put the cable in my bag.
I take my large suitcase.
I turn off the light and close the door.
